  The reel_script says the earlier escape happened 'அன்னூர் அடுத்த கணுவக்கரையில்' near Annur, but it is mixed with the Karnataka police detail in one sentence, merging two different facts (the Karnataka transfer and the Annur-area escape) so the sequence is unclear
  The caption says the earlier escape was when he was brought to Coimbatore 'ஒரு வழக்குக்காக' by Karnataka police, which is supported, but the caption adds 'நள்ளிரவு 1 மணி' as the time of the 'நேரம்' line while the article gives it as the time of the escape, consistent — no issue there
